{
  "name": "An overdue external deliverable ranks above self-set stale dates even when its forecast is unmeasured",
  "why": "A passed effective deadline is overdue severity even when the forecast could not measure the project, so an unbroken-down deliverable past its external date must not read as merely due this week. An action whose own self-set date has passed demotes to a stale date and yields to live pressure. At the captured moment the overdue deliverables carry the tier `overdue_external`, above the `ordinary` and `stale_date` actions, and the page can say what is blocked even while the energy gate keeps them from leading.",
